{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type ChatMiddlewarePhase = \n  | \"init\"\n  | \"beforeModel\"\n  | \"afterModel\"\n  | \"modelStream\"\n  | \"beforeTools\"\n  | \"afterTools\"\n  | \"structuredOutput\";","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L90","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:90"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Phase of the chat middleware lifecycle."}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"'init': Initial config transform before the chat engine starts"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"'beforeModel': Before each adapter chatStream call (per agent iteration)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"'afterModel': After each adapter chatStream call (per agent iteration)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"'modelStream': During model streaming"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"'beforeTools': Before tool execution phase"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"'afterTools': After tool execution phase"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"'structuredOutput': During the final structured-output adapter call (set\nfor chunks from adapter.structuredOutputStream or the synthesized fallback)"}]}]}]}],"headings":[]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype ChatMiddlewarePhase = \n  | \"init\"\n  | \"beforeModel\"\n  | \"afterModel\"\n  | \"modelStream\"\n  | \"beforeTools\"\n  | \"afterTools\"\n  | \"structuredOutput\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:90](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L90)\n\nPhase of the chat middleware lifecycle.\n- 'init': Initial config transform before the chat engine starts\n- 'beforeModel': Before each adapter chatStream call (per agent iteration)\n- 'afterModel': After each adapter chatStream call (per agent iteration)\n- 'modelStream': During model streaming\n- 'beforeTools': Before tool execution phase\n- 'afterTools': After tool execution phase\n- 'structuredOutput': During the final structured-output adapter call (set\n  for chunks from adapter.structuredOutputStream or the synthesized fallback)\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: ChatMiddlewarePhase\ntitle: ChatMiddlewarePhase\n---\n\n```ts\ntype ChatMiddlewarePhase = \n  | \"init\"\n  | \"beforeModel\"\n  | \"afterModel\"\n  | \"modelStream\"\n  | \"beforeTools\"\n  | \"afterTools\"\n  | \"structuredOutput\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:90](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L90)\n\nPhase of the chat middleware lifecycle.\n- 'init': Initial config transform before the chat engine starts\n- 'beforeModel': Before each adapter chatStream call (per agent iteration)\n- 'afterModel': After each adapter chatStream call (per agent iteration)\n- 'modelStream': During model streaming\n- 'beforeTools': Before tool execution phase\n- 'afterTools': After tool execution phase\n- 'structuredOutput': During the final structured-output adapter call (set\n  for chunks from adapter.structuredOutputStream or the synthesized fallback)\n"}
